            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koreshi mzuri wa Pashia waghora huwu: BWANA, uo Mlungu wa mlungunyi, waninekie kubonya nguma wurumwengunyi kose, nao wanilaghirie nimuaghie Hekalu Jerusalemu, iko Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 44.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ndekaie nenyo mmbose muko wandu wake. Ghendenyi Jerusalemu muiaghe sena Hekalu ya BWANA, Mlungu wa Israeli, uo utaswagha Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndungi wa wandu wake usigharikie wubarishonyi ukakunda wutesia ghowuya uteselo ni wambao kwa feza na dhahabu; kwa vilambo na nyamandu, chiaimweri na mafunyo ghefunya kwa wundu ghwa Hekalu ya Mlungu iko Jerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wabaa wa kichuku cha Juda na Benjamini, na wakohani, na Walawi, na kula mundu orenyavushiroghe ngolo ni Mlungu, ukakuwika nicha kujoka uendeagha Hekalu ya BWANA iko Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose werekwanyeghe wikawitesia kwa vilambo va feza, na dhahabu, na vilambo, nyamandu, na manosi gha zoghori mbaa, na mafunyo kwa wundu ghwa Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Koreshi ukawiwunjira vija vikombe na bakuli ra Hekalu ya BWANA veredwaloghe ni Mzuri Nebukadnezari kufuma Jerusalemu na kuwikwa hekalunyi kwa milungu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukavifunya ivo vilambo na kuvineka Mithredathi uo orekoghe m'baa wa mali ra wuzuri. Ukaandika mtalo ghwaro kwa wundu ghwa Sheshbaza m'baa wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtalo ghwaro ni ughu: Ngarai mirongo idadu ra dhahabu, ngarai elfu imweri ra feza, chuwigha refukira marumba mirongo iwi na ikenda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakuli mirongo idadu ra dhahabu, bakuli maghana ana na ikumi ra feza, na vombo vizima elfu imweri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vombo va dhahabu na va feza verekoghe elfu isanu maghana ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
